{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこ収録～(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタバタしてて昨日は\n熱が出ちゃったんだけど\nお薬と栄養ドリンクを\n飲みまくって寝たら\n少し良くなりましたヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも季節の変わり目だから\n体調気をつけてくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、花粉症も_(┐「ε:)_じゅる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまたシャキイズム\nオフショットヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/10/1515227/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみ:俺の寧々を返せ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい:返さねーぞっ！寧々は俺のだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみ:返せって言ってんだろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボコボコ(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/10/1515227/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい:きゃあ～っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとまいまいが男役で\nかっこよく寧々を取り合ってた\nのにまいまいがこけた瞬間、\n転び方が女の子に戻ってて\n可愛かったのヾ(-ω-*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがまいまい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ\n今日放送の乃木どこは\n5thキャンペーンの\nスカイダイビング～(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみか真夏か..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はたまた別の人が？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛ぶのでチェックして下さ～い♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/10/1515227/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みっくっもっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまなったんとおしゃべり\ntime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんはホラーって苦手だっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aお化け屋敷には入れないけど\nホラー映画を見るのは好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも見たあとは怖くて\nトイレにいけません(*´･ω･`)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q最近布団入ってから\nすぐ寝れないんだよー。\n真夏はすぐ寝れる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A3秒くらいで寝ます(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ\n車とか乗っても数秒で\n眠りにつきます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまだ結果きてないんですが、何話すか考えてます。逆にまなったんはどういう話しすると嬉しい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A来てくれた方がハマってることとか好きなこと、真夏にして欲しいこととかなんでも嬉しいですっ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ5thの握手会も\n始まるしたくさん会って\nお話したいなぁ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q玲香にも同じ質問したけれど\nメンバーを呼び捨てで呼んでも大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A大丈夫ですよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな呼び方でもOKヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/03/10/%E3%81%BE%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A4%EF%BC%92.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅ～っ♡"}],"source":"archive"}